</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Anointed King, with glory crowned,</l><l>Rightful Heir and Lord of all!</l><l>Once rejected, scorned, disowned,</l><l>E’en by those Thou cam’st to call:</l><l>Thee we honor, Thee adore—</l><l>Glorious now and evermore.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Lord of life! to death once subject;</l><l>Blesser, yet a curse once made;</l><l>Of Thy Father’s heart the object,</l><l>Yet in depths of anguish laid;</l><l>Thee we gaze on, Thee recall—</l><l>Bearing here our sorrows all.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Royal robes shall soon invest Thee,</l><l>Royal splendors crown Thy brow;</l><l>Christ of God, our souls confess Thee</l><l>King and Sov’reign even now!</l><l>Thee we rev’rence, Thee obey—</l><l>Own Thee Lord and Christ alway.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
